{
  "description": "Reviewed catalogue query set for lexical search relevance measurement. Relevance rules are normalized the same way as the catalog text they match: NFC, lowercased, 'ё' folded to 'е', punctuation collapsed to single spaces. A book is relevant when its normalized title contains expected_normalized_title; when expected_normalized_author is also set, the book must additionally have an author whose normalized full name contains it. An author is relevant when the normalized full name contains expected_normalized_author. Only visible rows count: approved, not duplicate_hidden, and matching language when language is set.",
